{
  "id": "193",
  "document": "静躁独行.txt",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "193:p0",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "$t1 == '193'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44907:44923"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44923:44925"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“亚历克斯？”你朝着黑暗中问了一声。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44925:44945"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“嗯？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44945:44951"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“这是怎么了？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44951:44961"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“停电了，我猜。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44961:44972"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "从黑暗中，你听到亚历克斯一只手扶着墙、拖着脚步挪动时碰到东西的杂乱声音。她来回拨了几次电灯开关。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44972:45022"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我觉得这个地方是靠太阳能供电的？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45022:45042"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“他的确是这么说的。可能什么东西坏掉了。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45042:45065"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“有备用电源或者什么东西吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45065:45082"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p10",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“我不知道。我猜明天早上我得到镇里去给马克打电话问问。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45082:45112"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p11",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“哦，那可是太好了。”你握着拳顶着自己的眉心。“好吧，怎样都好。”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45112:45147"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p12",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你的心脏仍然因为刚才的噪音狂跳着。你把手从脸上拿开。小屋里漆黑一片。焦虑开始在你心中翻腾。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45147:45194"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p13",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "如果记录表上的 心碎 或 推卸责任 有至少一项被勾选，则你无法依赖亚历克斯的支持。必须转到 207。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45194:45246"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p14",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要向亚历克斯寻求支持，转到 205。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45246:45266"
    },
    {
      "id": "193:p15",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要就这样睡觉，转到 207。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:45266:45282"
    }
  ]
}
